<title>THAILAND: IFCT Finance Q3 net up 105 pct.</title>
<headline>IFCT Finance Q3 net up 105 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for three and nine months ending September 30.</p>
<p>		   (in million of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Three months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		  0.53	 vs	  0.36</p>
<p>    Net			  37.25	 vs	 18.16</p>
<p>			     Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		  2.03	 vs	  1.54</p>
<p>    Net			 141.98	 vs	 67.70</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is IFCT Finance and Securities Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
